meta {
  name: Notifications - Mark as seen
  type: http
  seq: 149
}

post {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/notifications/seen
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "notification_cuids": ["n4notificationexample0001", "n4notificationexample0002"]
  }
}

docs {
  The lines were on screen (#1474): sets seen_at on 1 to 100 notifications of the current member. A cuid that is not a notification of the member is ignored. An empty list gives 400. Needs notifications:write.
}
